# 🔍 Explainable AI Analysis (XAI)

The repository applies `DALEX` and unified SHAP-based architectures to interpret ensemble model predictions and reduce algorithmic opacity.

## Global SHAP Attributions

Quantification of the contribution of:

- MCA infrastructure dimensions
- Real income shocks
- Employment-related characteristics

to household poverty risk predictions.

## Break-Down Plots

Four representative cases were analyzed:

- Maximum predicted poverty probability
- Minimum predicted poverty probability
- Two borderline cases

This allows the identification of the main drivers behind individual predictions.

